   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Se» + present",
     "texto": [
      "With a factual or habitual condition, use **se** + present: **Se chove muito no inverno, fico em casa** (if it rains a lot in winter, I stay at home). **Se tens fome, come uma sopa** (if you're hungry, eat a soup).",
      "For a future possibility, like «if it rains tomorrow», use the future subjunctive; you'll see it in chapter 25."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Quando» + present",
     "texto": [
      "The present with **quando** describes a habitual situation: **Quando chove, fico em casa** (when it rains, I stay at home). For a specific future event, the futuro do conjuntivo is usually used: **Quando chover, fico em casa** (when it rains, I will stay at home).",
      "**Se** sets out a condition; **quando** places an event."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
